ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260818/202608182318283643_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260818/202608182318283643_720.jpg"> </div><p>【巴萨官宣签下罗德里】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84789a38dc5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金球先生加盟！官方：巴萨签下30岁曼城中场罗德里，总价7500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190054234171.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190054234171.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190054234171.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，巴萨签下30岁曼城中场罗德里，双方签约至2030年。据罗马诺报道，巴萨签下罗德里的转会总价为7500万欧元</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a8490a8c02b1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗德里：离开曼城的决定很艰难；我还有其他的选择，但巴萨是首选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190104513712.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190104513712_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190104513712_720.jpg"> </div><p>在亮相仪式上，罗德里接受媒体采访谈及自己加盟巴萨的心情。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a848f2f7b8d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗德里告别曼城：我的心永远是蓝色的；只要曼城需要，我永远都在</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190234159548.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190234159548.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190234159548.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，巴萨签下30岁曼城中场罗德里，双方签约至2030年。在抵达巴塞罗那前，罗德里接受了曼城官方的采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a8488c24f447native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：巴萨给罗德里3400万税前年薪 加佣金转会费总价2.1亿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2.29" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190046168711_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2.29" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2.29" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190046168711_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190046168711_720.jpg"> </div><p>据《阿斯报》报道，巴萨为罗德里开税前年薪3400万欧元，再算上转会费和经纪人佣金，这笔交易的总成本将超过2.1亿欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84ae8fce046native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">弗里克：罗德里也许是最好的6号位球员，能为任何队带来特别东西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f497d3cbe58.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f497d3cbe58.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251019/68f497d3cbe58.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨官方宣布签下金球奖得主罗德里，对于这样的重磅新援，红蓝军团主帅弗里克发表了自己的看法。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a8491884790cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：万-比萨卡租借加盟维拉，附带强制买断条款</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190110269693_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190110269693_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190110269693_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，西汉姆联后卫万-比萨卡租借加盟维拉，附带强制买断条款。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a849861811e1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：纽卡有意曼城中场尼科，两家俱乐部已展开谈判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910d7fe235bb.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910d7fe235bb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251110/6910d7fe235bb.jpg"> </div><p>The athletic报道，纽卡正在就签下曼城中场尼科·冈萨雷斯进行谈判。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84a8a3d42ddnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打包价！记者：巴黎愿以总价1.75亿欧出售巴尔科拉和姆巴耶</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a75ff269ff96.jpg"> </div><p>记者Romain Molina报道，巴黎圣日耳曼愿以总价1.75亿欧元将巴尔科拉和姆巴耶出售至利物浦。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84aaa261a1fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：坎塞洛官宣推迟至甘伯杯后，亮相仪式受阻纯属因手续繁琐</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b705a6d2136.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b705a6d2136.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b705a6d2136.jpg"> </div><p>记者杰拉德·罗梅罗通过社交媒体发布最新消息称，关于坎塞洛加盟巴萨的官方公告将不会在8月20日的甘伯杯赛前正式发布，这意味着该名球员将无法参加明天的亮相仪式。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84bf949ec3dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：新月向维拉总价4500万欧报价沃特金斯，球员有意转会加盟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190426197976.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190426197976_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608190426197976_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺独家消息：利雅得新月正式向阿斯顿维拉报价求购沃特金斯，总金额4500万欧元，包含浮动条款。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a84d4e1813ffnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：利雅得新月4500万欧报价沃特金斯，预计将被维拉拒绝</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251204/6930b945a3d41.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251204/6930b945a3d41.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251204/6930b945a3d41.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic报道，利雅得新月已为阿斯顿维拉前锋沃特金斯开出正式报价，预计将被维拉拒绝。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-18/6a847a0738c78native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">图卢兹官方：米兰20岁中卫奥多古租借加盟，租期一个赛季</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260818/202608182333404565.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260818/202608182333404565.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260818/202608182333404565.jpg"> </div><p>图卢兹官方宣布中卫奥多古从米兰租借加盟，租期一个赛季。</p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/match2080517date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">挺进16强！利雅得胜利4-1迪里耶 C罗缺阵菲利克斯两射一传</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260819/zhanbao_image_2080517_1787081879_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260819/zhanbao_image_2080517_1787081879_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260819/zhanbao_image_2080517_1787081879_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>利雅得胜利以4-1逆转击败迪里耶，顺利挺进沙王冠16强。本场C罗缺阵，菲利克斯两射一传。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/match2131157date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">拜仁4-2海登海姆 迪亚斯破门 穆西亚拉替补8分钟连场晕倒被换下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.du